{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0e2300f94868f720","name":"Labor Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-0e2300f94868f720","title":"Labor Droid","revision":21061,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:05:18Z","sha256":"aef5f7f4d24de91422f9f068c88fecbc56fc98dfd27d6c0e7c76796617f669f6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21061","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Labor%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0e2300f94868f720","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Labor Droids have the following Chassis Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Labor Droids receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},". Labor Droids are built for strength and durability.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Like other Droids, Labor Droids have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Labor Droids are typically of Medium size, gaining no bonuses or penalties for their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Labor Droids have a base speed of 6 squares and use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Traits:"]}," Labor Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["5th-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/5th-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:d4243a54b2193101"}," and have all Droid immunities and typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Traits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Traits"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Equipment:"]}," Labor Droids are constructed with the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," installed in each:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:14597e432df54ad5"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Claw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Claw","referenceId":"reference:587cfbbbcd42a71b"}," Appendages"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Durasteel Shell (+4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex"},") and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vocabulator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vocabulator","referenceId":"reference:a28880d579fbd223"}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Heavy Lifting:"]}," Labor Droids excel at manual labor. Labor Droids may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},"-based skill check, keeping the better of the two results."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Labor Droids can speak, read, and write both Basic and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
